te the representation of lives but also", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.12975912975912976, "x1": 0.7670329670329671, "y1": 0.14374514374514374}, {"text": "experiment with textual forms and features in response to different contexts.", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.14607614607614608, "x1": 0.7153846153846154, "y1": 0.16006216006216006}, {"text": "Evaluate this statement with reference to TWO prescribed texts AND texts of your own.", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.1623931623931624, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.17637917637917638}, {"text": "choosing.", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.17871017871017872, "x1": 0.1813186813186813, "y1": 0.1926961926961927}, {"text": "Question 2 \u2014 Elective 1: Life Writing (25 marks)", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.22843822843822845, "x1": 0.5197802197802198, "y1": 0.24164724164724163}, {"text": "Compose a piece of original imaginative writing using the following statement as the start of", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.26107226107226106, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.27505827505827507}, {"text": "a character\u2019s reflection on an important event in his or her life.", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.2773892773892774, "x1": 0.6054945054945055, "y1": 0.2905982905982906}, {"text": "The dead tell no lies; it\u2019s time I broke my silence.", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.2937062937062937, "x1": 0.6780219780219781, "y1": 0.30691530691530694}, {"text": "In your response, draw on your knowledge and understanding of Life Writing.", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.31002331002331, "x1": 0.7329670329670329, "y1": 0.32323232323232326}, {"text": "Question 3\u2014 Elective 2: Crime Writing (25 marks)", "x0": 0.10659340659340659, "y0": 0.358974358974359, "x1": 0.5395604395604395, "y1": 0.37218337218337216}, {"text": "In Crime Writing, composers not only scrutinise justice but also experiment with textual", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.3916083916083916, "x1": 0.8142857142857143, "y1": 0.40559440559440557}, 