text": "also experiment with textual forms and features in response to different contexts.", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.6705516705516705, "x1": 0.7538461538461538, "y1": 0.6837606837606838}, {"text": "Evaluate this statement with reference to TWO prescribed texts AND texts of your own", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.6868686868686869, "x1": 0.8098901098901099, "y1": 0.7008547008547008}, {"text": "choosing.", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.7031857031857032, "x1": 0.1824175824175824, "y1": 0.7163947163947164}, {"text": "Question 6 \u2014 Elective 3: Science Fiction (25 marks)", "x0": 0.10659340659340659, "y0": 0.7521367521367521, "x1": 0.5406593406593406, "y1": 0.7661227661227661}, {"text": "Compose a piece of original imaginative writing using the following statement as the start of", "x0": 0.10659340659340659, "y0": 0.7684537684537684, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.7824397824397824}, {"text": "a character\u2019s reflection on an important event in his or her life.", "x0": 0.10659340659340659, "y0": 0.7855477855477856, "x1": 0.6054945054945055, "y1": 0.7987567987567987}, {"text": "taken a giant step; nothing will be the same again.", "x0": 0.3076923076923077, "y0": 0.8018648018648019, "x1": 0.7065934065934066, "y1": 0.8158508158508159}, {"text": "In your response, draw on your knowledge and understanding of Science Fiction.", "x0": 0.1054945054945055, "y0": 0.8181818181818182, "x1": 0.756043956043956, "y1": 0.8313908313908314}], [{"text": "Module B: Texts and Ways of Thinking", "x0": 0.11098901098901098, "y0": 0.09246309246309246, "x1": 0.5076923076923077, "y1": 0.108003108003108}, {"text": "50 marks", "x0": 0.11208791208791209, "y0": 0.1111111111111111, "x1": 0.1912087912087912, "y1": 0.12121212121212122}, {"text": "You must attempt TWO questions from the elective you have studied", "x0": 0.11098901098901098, "y0": 0.14296814296814297, "x1": 0.7032967032967034, "y1": 0.15695415695415696}, {"text": "Allow about 1 hour for each question", "x0": 0.1109