"x0": 0.10989010989010989, "y0": 0.4444444444444444, "x1": 0.5538461538461539, "y1": 0.45843045843045843}, {"text": "\u2014 Samuel Beckett, Waiting for Godot", "x0": 0.10989010989010989, "y0": 0.47707847707847706, "x1": 0.41208791208791207, "y1": 0.49106449106449107}, {"text": "+ Poetry", "x0": 0.11098901098901098, "y0": 0.49417249417249415, "x1": 0.17912087912087912, "y1": 0.5073815073815073}, {"text": "\u2014 Sylvia Plath, Ariel", "x0": 0.10989010989010989, "y0": 0.5104895104895105, "x1": 0.27472527472527475, "y1": 0.5236985236985237}, {"text": "* Daddy", "x0": 0.23296703296703297, "y0": 0.5268065268065268, "x1": 0.3010989010989011, "y1": 0.54001554001554}, {"text": "* Lady Lazarus", "x0": 0.23296703296703297, "y0": 0.5431235431235432, "x1": 0.35714285714285715, "y1": 0.5563325563325563}, {"text": "* The Applicant", "x0": 0.23296703296703297, "y0": 0.5594405594405595, "x1": 0.36043956043956044, "y1": 0.5726495726495726}, {"text": "* Morning Song", "x0": 0.23296703296703297, "y0": 0.5757575757575758, "x1": 0.3637362637362637, "y1": 0.5897435897435898}, {"text": "* Words", "x0": 0.23296703296703297, "y0": 0.5920745920745921, "x1": 0.2989010989010989, "y1": 0.602952602952603}, {"text": "* Fever 103\u00b0", "x0": 0.23296703296703297, "y0": 0.6091686091686092, "x1": 0.3373626373626374, "y1": 0.6192696192696193}, {"text": "* The Arrival of the Bee Box", "x0": 0.23296703296703297, "y0": 0.6247086247086248, "x1": 0.46153846153846156, "y1": 0.6386946386946387}, {"text": "+ Nonfiction", "x0": 0.11098901098901098, "y0": 0.6418026418026418, "x1": 0.21318681318681318, "y1": 0.6526806526806527}, {"text": "\u2014 John Hersey, Hiroshima", "x0": 0.10989010989010989, "y0": 0.6581196581196581, "x1": 0.3230769230769231, "y1": 0.6713286713286714}, {"text": "Year 12 English Oral Assessment 16 August 2012", "x0": 0.056043956043956046, "y0": 0.6604506604506605, "x1": 0.07472527472527472, "y1": 0.9370629370629371}, {"text": "Elective 2: Romanticism \u2014 Attempt Questions 9 and 10", "x0"